# PREPARATION ONLY. The existing core and its database/disk stay in place.
# NEW web gateway (separate paid service):
# Build command: node --check gateway-server.js
# Start command: node gateway-server.js
# No disk, Aligo worker, BAND membership sidecar, or database on this role.
CREO_BACKEND_URL=https://creok.onrender.com
CREO_PUBLIC_ORIGIN=https://creok.onrender.com

# EXISTING core: activate only after verifying the new gateway's UI/API/auth.
# CREO_FRONTEND_ORIGIN=https://REPLACE_WITH_NEW_WEB_SERVICE.onrender.com
# Keep its start command, secrets, disk and CREO_DATA_DIR unchanged.
# Add ignored paths to its existing build filter: public/**, gateway-server.js, deploy/**, docs/**
# Keep all other existing filters. UI-only commits then deploy only the gateway.
# Rollback: remove CREO_FRONTEND_ORIGIN; old public files are still on the core.
# No database copy or second auction/notification worker is required.
